stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> REJECTED : our rules, risk or throttle refuse (never sent)
    [*] --> PENDING : sent to the broker
    PENDING --> OPEN : broker accepts
    PENDING --> PARTIAL
    PENDING --> FILLED
    PENDING --> CANCELLED
    PENDING --> REJECTED : broker refuses
    OPEN --> PARTIAL : part fills
    OPEN --> FILLED
    OPEN --> CANCELLED
    OPEN --> REJECTED
    PARTIAL --> FILLED
    PARTIAL --> CANCELLED : the rest is cancelled
    FILLED --> [*]
    CANCELLED --> [*]
    REJECTED --> [*]
    note right of PENDING
      UNCONFIRMED: place got no clear answer
      (timeout, dropped connection). Never assumed
      rejected; the broker's order list settles it.
    end note
